ELM-DART DATM forcing for E3SMv3
==================================

This directory documents atmospheric forcing for ELM cases that use the E3SM
data atmosphere component (DATM). The configuration was checked against:

  E3SM source: /qfs/people/zhan391/e3sm_dart_work/code/E3SMv3
  branch:      v3_dart_cda
  revision:    1eda4d4dcacd9ff603764264d5bf8ca861b97ac1
  version:     v3.0.2-96-g1eda4d4dca

Model roles
-----------

EAM is the active E3SM atmosphere model. DATM is the data atmosphere used to
force an ELM-only case. Thus, EAM or atmospheric-reanalysis output is the
source, DATM is the forcing component, and ELM is the consumer.

Recommended E3SM configuration
------------------------------

E3SMv3 provides native CPLHIST support. Configure it from the case directory:

  ./xmlchange DATM_MODE=CPLHIST
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_DIR=/absolute/path/to/coupler/history
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_CASE=CASE_PREFIX
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_YR_ALIGN=START_YEAR
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_YR_START=START_YEAR
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_YR_END=END_YEAR
  ./xmlchange DATM_CPLHIST_DOMAIN_FILE=null

With DATM_CPLHIST_DOMAIN_FILE=null, E3SM reads domain information from the
first coupler-history stream file. The forcing grid should match the ELM grid;
otherwise an explicit domain and remapping strategy are required.

Native CPLHIST file contract
----------------------------

The E3SMv3 defaults expect monthly files named:

  CASE_PREFIX.cpl.ha2x3h.YYYY-MM.nc

The same files supply four streams:

  CPLHISTForcing.Solar
    a2x3h_Faxa_swndr, a2x3h_Faxa_swvdr,
    a2x3h_Faxa_swndf, a2x3h_Faxa_swvdf

  CPLHISTForcing.nonSolarFlux
    a2x3h_Faxa_rainc, a2x3h_Faxa_rainl,
    a2x3h_Faxa_snowc, a2x3h_Faxa_snowl, a2x3h_Faxa_lwdn

  CPLHISTForcing.State3hr
    a2x3h_Sa_z, a2x3h_Sa_tbot, a2x3h_Sa_ptem, a2x3h_Sa_shum,
    a2x3h_Sa_pbot, a2x3h_Sa_dens, a2x3h_Sa_pslv,
    a2x3h_Sa_co2diag, a2x3h_Sa_co2prog

  CPLHISTForcing.State1hr
    a2x3h_Sa_u, a2x3h_Sa_v

Despite the historical State1hr stream name, the E3SMv3 default mapping uses
a2x3h wind variables. Solar and flux streams use nearest-time selection;
state streams use linear interpolation. E3SMv3 applies offsets of 2700 seconds
to Solar and 900 seconds to the other three streams.

Before case.setup
-----------------

Confirm that every monthly file:

* has time units and a calendar consistent with the ELM case;
* has monotonic time coordinates with no missing intervals;
* contains lon, lat, area, and mask when the domain file is null;
* contains all required a2x3h variables;
* has no NaNs or physically invalid downward radiation/precipitation; and
* uses the same horizontal grid for all four logical streams.

No lnd_import_export SourceMod is required for DATM. Invalid negative forcing
should be corrected in the forcing files rather than by replacing ELM coupling
code.

Legacy archive utilities
------------------------

legacy_cam/ contains the pre-E3SM scripts for retrieving and repackaging the
1997-2010 CAM/POP coupler-history archive. They produce six-hourly ha2x1dx6h
files and do not satisfy the native E3SMv3 CPLHIST contract without custom
stream definitions. They are retained only for reproducibility.
